       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. S30150.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FORM0           PIC X(40).
       01  WS-PAGE0           PIC X(80).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DISPLAY 'START'.
           GOBACK.

       ECHO-NAME0.
           EXEC CICS WEB READ FORMFIELD('name') VALUE(WS-FORM0) END-EXEC.
           STRING '<p>' WS-FORM0 '</p>' DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-PAGE0.
           EXEC CICS WEB SEND FROM(WS-PAGE0) END-EXEC.

